{
  "name": "Order Status Email Automation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ SETUP (10 min)\n\n1. **Google Sheets**: pairs with the Orders sheet from 'Etsy Order to Google Sheets + Notification' — needs columns: Order ID | Buyer Name | Buyer Email | Item | Status | Email Sent.\n   Update the Status column yourself (Confirmed / Shipped / Delivered) as orders progress (or connect it to your fulfillment process).\n2. Connect your Google credentials in 'Read Orders Sheet'.\n3. **Gmail**: connect the sending account on all three email nodes.\n4. This runs every 30 minutes, finds rows whose Status changed since the last email, sends the matching templated email, then updates 'Email Sent' so it's never sent twice.\n\nThen activate the workflow (top-right toggle).",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "7567aa3a-7c97-4f04-b52a-b4b292e2f655",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 30
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "4c3756ba-f780-4361-8070-f3d380f6acf8",
      "name": "Every 30 Minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        420,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "14d6bd0b-6660-4293-8e42-3ccd39a79c51",
      "name": "Read Orders Sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        640,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const changed = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const row = item.json;\n  const status = String(row.Status || '').trim();\n  const emailSent = String(row['Email Sent'] || '').trim();\n  if (status && status !== emailSent) changed.push(item);\n}\nreturn changed;"
      },
      "id": "300a1c80-52f8-4d72-acbd-cb3897a0b125",
      "name": "Find Status Changes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        860,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "outputKey": "Confirmed",
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "67909f96-3080-4f52-b91b-aefa2265b6cb",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals",
                      "singleValue": true
                    },
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.Status }}",
                    "rightValue": "Confirmed"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true
            },
            {
              "outputKey": "Shipped",
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "7ab34f6f-6d40-4d8e-bb85-1b796a76a489",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals",
                      "singleValue": true
                    },
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.Status }}",
                    "rightValue": "Shipped"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true
            },
            {
              "outputKey": "Delivered",
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "b9e55245-cbcd-40aa-bbee-779ed66678cc",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals",
                      "singleValue": true
                    },
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.Status }}",
                    "rightValue": "Delivered"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "81357c09-044e-4959-9081-46e11c4258ba",
      "name": "Route by Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1080,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json['Buyer Email'] }}",
        "subject": "=Your order #{{ $json['Order ID'] }} is confirmed",
        "message": "=Hi {{ $json['Buyer Name'] }},\n\nYour order for \"{{ $json.Item }}\" is confirmed and being prepared. We'll email you again once it ships.\n\nThank you!\n[YOUR SHOP NAME]",
        "options": {}
